  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "一百种牌型叠加一百四十四件神器，让每手麻将爆出组合",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "With over 100 Patterns and 144 unique Artifacts, every hand you play can unleash unbelievable combos.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "种子关卡每局重洗神器、道具与强化，保证流程持续变化",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Aotenjo's levels are seeded to generate new Artifacts, gadgets, and augments each time you play. No two runs are the same, ensuring a fresh and challenging experience with every game.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "汇集四十多种地区麻将，从两门牌挑战延伸到宝牌与花牌",
      "dimension": "题材",
      "excerpt": "Inspired by over 40 different regional Mahjong styles, Aotenjo offers a blend of familiarity and novelty. Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned player of Richii, MCR, or Cantonese Mahjong, you’ll find something to enjoy. From Two-Suit Only challenges to Dora and Flower Tiles, we have it all!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3066570/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
